#: data/org.tabos.stamp.metainfo.xml.in:6
msgid "Mails and more"
msgstr ""

#: data/org.tabos.stamp.metainfo.xml.in:8
msgid ""
"Stamp is a modern personal information management application that provides "
"integrated mail and contacts functionality, designed for the GNOME desktop."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.tabos.stamp.metainfo.xml.in:9
msgid ""
"Built on the Evolution Data Server stack, Stamp supports a wide range of "
"industry standard data formats and network protocols for information "
"exchange, with an emphasis on standards compliance and security. Messages "
"can be signed and encrypted using OpenPGP and S/MIME, and Stamp supports "
"Brand Indicators for Message Identification (BIMI) as well as one-click "
"unsubscribe from mailing lists."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.tabos.stamp.metainfo.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"Manage your email accounts, stay on top of your conversations and keep your "
"address books in sync — all in a clean, focused and privacy-friendly "
"interface."
msgstr ""

